 "explanation": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "split p at \"*\" into literal pieces; the first piece must be a prefix of s and the last a suffix (when p has a \"*\"), and each middle piece is placed at its leftmost occurrence after the previous one, which is optimal because \"*\" absorbs any gap. Complexity target: O(|s| * |p|) worst case with a linear substring search, usually near linear/O(|p|) space.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
